# Blog API

A RESTful API for managing blog articles built with Node.js, Express, SQLite, and Swagger.

## Installation

1. Clone the repository
2. Run `npm install`
3. Run `npm start` or `npm run dev`

## Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/articles` | Create a new article |
| GET | `/api/articles` | Get all articles (filter by ?category=, ?author=, ?date=) |
| GET | `/api/articles/:id` | Get a single article by ID |
| PUT | `/api/articles/:id` | Update an article |
| DELETE | `/api/articles/:id` | Delete an article |
| GET | `/api/articles/search?query=` | Search articles by title or content |

## Documentation

Swagger documentation is available at `/api-docs` when the server is running.

## Technologies

- Node.js
- Express
- SQLite3
- Swagger UI Express
